      "summaries": {
        "en": "OpenCode is an open-source coding agent that automates software development tasks by understanding natural language instructions and generating functional code. It leverages large language models to interpret developer intent and produce working implementations across multiple programming languages. Developers can integrate it into their workflows through its TypeScript API to automate repetitive coding tasks, prototype ideas quickly, or assist with code generation in integrated development environments.",
        "zh": "OpenCode是一个开源编码代理，能够理解自然语言指令并自动生成可运行代码，帮助开发者自动化编程任务。它基于大型语言模型技术，通过解析开发者的需求描述来生成多种编程语言的实现代码。该项目采用TypeScript开发，提供了清晰的API接口，开发者可以将其集成到自己的开发流程中，用于快速原型构建、自动化代码生成或辅助编程工作，特别适合需要频繁处理重复编码模式的场景。",
        "es": "OpenCode is an open-source coding agent that automates software development tasks by understanding natural language instructions and generating functional code. It leverages large language models to interpret developer intent and produce working implementations across multiple programming languages. Developers can integrate it into their workflows through its TypeScript API to automate repetitive coding tasks, prototype ideas quickly, or assist with code generation in integrated development environments.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "opencode gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "OpenCode is an open-source coding agent that automates software development tasks by understanding natural language instructions and generating functional code. It leverages large language models to interpret developer intent and produce working implementations across multiple programming languages. Developers can integrate it into their workflows through its TypeScript API to automate repetitive coding tasks, prototype ideas quickly, or assist with code generation in integrated development environments.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/sst/opencode for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
