        "en": "JoltPhysics is a high-performance rigid body physics and collision detection library designed for modern game development and VR applications. Its key innovation is a multi-core friendly architecture that efficiently distributes physics calculations across CPU cores, enabling complex simulations without performance bottlenecks. Developers can integrate it into C++ game engines to create realistic object interactions, vehicle physics, or environmental destruction systems, with Horizon Forbidden West demonstrating its production-ready capabilities in AAA gaming.",
        "zh": "JoltPhysics是一个专为现代游戏和VR应用设计的高性能刚体物理与碰撞检测库。它通过多核友好的架构创新，将物理计算任务高效分配到多个CPU核心上，解决了传统物理引擎在复杂场景下的性能瓶颈问题。开发者可以将其集成到C++游戏引擎中，用于实现逼真的物体交互、车辆物理或环境破坏系统，其技术已被《地平线：西之绝境》等AAA游戏验证，为独立开发者到大型工作室提供了可靠的物理模拟解决方案。",
        "es": "JoltPhysics is a high-performance rigid body physics and collision detection library designed for modern game development and VR applications. Its key innovation is a multi-core friendly architecture that efficiently distributes physics calculations across CPU cores, enabling complex simulations without performance bottlenecks. Developers can integrate it into C++ game engines to create realistic object interactions, vehicle physics, or environmental destruction systems, with Horizon Forbidden West demonstrating its production-ready capabilities in AAA gaming.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "JoltPhysics stands out for c-plus-plus, cpp, and game-development in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "JoltPhysics is a high-performance rigid body physics and collision detection library designed for modern game development and VR applications. Its key innovation is a multi-core friendly architecture that efficiently distributes physics calculations across CPU cores, enabling complex simulations without performance bottlenecks. Developers can integrate it into C++ game engines to create realistic object interactions, vehicle physics, or environmental destruction systems, with Horizon Forbidden West demonstrating its production-ready capabilities in AAA gaming.",
