      "summaries": {
        "en": "pg-aiguide is an MCP server and Claude plugin that helps AI coding assistants generate more accurate PostgreSQL queries by providing them with structured database knowledge. It works by exposing PostgreSQL schema information, documentation, and query patterns through the Model Context Protocol, allowing AI tools to access real-time database context. Developers can integrate it with Claude Code or other MCP-compatible tools to get AI-generated SQL that respects their specific database structure, making it practical for prototyping queries or learning PostgreSQL best practices through interactive coding.",
        "zh": "pg-aiguide 是一个 MCP 服务器和 Claude 插件，旨在通过为 AI 编码助手提供结构化数据库知识来生成更准确的 PostgreSQL 查询。它通过模型上下文协议暴露 PostgreSQL 的模式信息、文档和查询模式，使 AI 工具能够访问实时数据库上下文。开发者可将其与 Claude Code 或其他兼容 MCP 的工具集成，从而获得尊重其特定数据库结构的 AI 生成 SQL，适用于快速原型设计查询或通过交互式编码学习 PostgreSQL 最佳实践，提升开发效率与代码质量。",
        "es": "pg-aiguide is an MCP server and Claude plugin that helps AI coding assistants generate more accurate PostgreSQL queries by providing them with structured database knowledge. It works by exposing PostgreSQL schema information, documentation, and query patterns through the Model Context Protocol, allowing AI tools to access real-time database context. Developers can integrate it with Claude Code or other MCP-compatible tools to get AI-generated SQL that respects their specific database structure, making it practical for prototyping queries or learning PostgreSQL best practices through interactive coding.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "pg-aiguide stands out for ai, ai-agents, and ai-coding in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "pg-aiguide is an MCP server and Claude plugin that helps AI coding assistants generate more accurate PostgreSQL queries by providing them with structured database knowledge. It works by exposing PostgreSQL schema information, documentation, and query patterns through the Model Context Protocol, allowing AI tools to access real-time database context. Developers can integrate it with Claude Code or other MCP-compatible tools to get AI-generated SQL that respects their specific database structure, making it practical for prototyping queries or learning PostgreSQL best practices through interactive coding.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/timescale/pg-aiguide for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
